window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Lucien</b></p> <p>Times have changed. Our old enemy has reemerged, bringing chaos. Old friends we thought lost forever have returned. Everything isn't as it seems.</p> <p>I broke her. I would do it again to keep her safe. No matter how far she tries to run, I will find her.</p> <p><b>Scarlett</b></p> <p>He broke my heart with his lies.</p> <p>I left to keep the people I love safe.</p> <p>Now I have to return.</p>"; 
